<article class="narrow prose">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated <?= e(nice_date('2026-11-19 00:00:00')) ?></p>
  <p>This policy explains what information My 1 Secret ("we") collects when you use my1secret.com and how we use it.</p>
  <h2>Information you give us</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account details:</strong> your username, email address and password (stored only as a secure one-way hash). Your email is never shown publicly; we use it for password resets and important account notices.</li>
    <li><strong>Posting without an account:</strong> if you post or comment as a guest, we store the name and email you enter. Your name is shown with your post; your email is never shown. We use it once to send a link that confirms and publishes your first contribution, and to contact you about your posts if needed.</li>
    <li><strong>Profile:</strong> the optional display name and bio you add.</li>
    <li><strong>Content:</strong> posts, comments, images, votes and reports you submit. Posts, comments and your username are public. Votes and reports are not shown publicly.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> we set an essential session cookie when you log in, and a cookie that remembers the name and email you used as a guest (so you don't retype them and so confirmed guests can post instantly). </li>
    <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site (pages viewed, how you arrived, device and browser type, approximate location). Google sets its own cookies for this and processes the data under <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a> or by blocking cookies in your browser.</li>
    <li><strong>Security records:</strong> to prevent spam and abuse we briefly record IP addresses alongside sign-in, sign-up and posting attempts. These records are deleted automatically after about two days.</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> our hosting provider keeps standard web server logs (IP address, pages requested, browser type) for security and reliability.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links to products on Amazon are affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate, My 1 Secret earns from qualifying purchases, at no extra cost to you. When you click one, Amazon may set its own cookies under Amazon's privacy policy; we do not receive any information about what you buy.</p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>To run the site and your account, display your contributions, prevent spam and abuse, enforce our <a href="/community-guidelines/">community guidelines</a>, and respond to you. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
  <h2>Deleting your content</h2>
  <p>You can edit or delete your own posts and comments at any time. To delete your account entirely, contact us using the details on our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> from the email address on your account.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>My 1 Secret is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. We will change the date above when we do.</p>
